  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HEPNET 06-10  UnvCapeTown</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HEPNET 06-10 UnvCapeTown - Cape/HEPNET 06-10</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med insatsen &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kapaciteten inom omr&#xe5;det h&#xe4;lsoekonomi i regionen. Att bygga upp och underh&#xe5;lla denna kapacitet f&#xf6;r att bidra till fattigdomsorienterade h&#xe4;lsosystem i regionen. Ett annat m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka l&#xe4;nkarna emllan forskningsinstitutioner och anv&#xe4;dnarna/policy makers. HEPNET administreras av ekonomiska fakulteten p&#xe5; universitetet i Cape Town, Sydafrika.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to improve the capacity of health economics in the region, to build and sustain this capacity and to contribute to pro poor and equity oriented health systems in SSA. It also aims at strengthening links between research institutions and users/policy makers. HEPNET is administered by the Health Economics Unit (HEU) at School of Medicine at University of Cape Town.</narrative>
  </description>
